":"Talk 2","text":"Hm? Do you need something?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"My skin is sensitive to sunlight. So please assign me to nighttime missions, whenever you can.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"There's limits to what I'm capable of, but even so, I want to help ease the burden you carry, Doctor.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"I can't help but feel just a little envious when I see how the other Operators fight...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"I need no particular reason to fight for you, Doctor. I hope to see an exciting frontline battle someday...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Doctor, let me be your guardian, now and forever...","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Vanguard Yato here. Are you the one I'm protecting?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"Thank you.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Yato has joined the team.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"We're ready to execute your plans, Doctor.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"All Operators, be on alert.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"Targets spotted. Get ready for battle.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"Here.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Go ahead.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Got it.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Understood!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"In a blink of eye!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Prepare yourself!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"Haaaaghhh!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"Slash you down!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"As long as we follow the Doctor's orders, we won't have any problems.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"The Doctor's brilliant command was the key to victory.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"Victory is the most welcome news.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"I apologize... We failed to execute your plan, Doctor...","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"Please send me somewhere that sunlight can never touch.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"*Gasp*!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"Doctor, thank you for always taking care of us.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Happy holidays, Doctor. Thank you for your work over the past year, and may you continue to guide us this year.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"Doctor, I will be your shield.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Happy birthday, Doctor. Please, accept this humble gift. Yes, of course I remember your birthday.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"A blade needs a sheath. It is a shelter, and a place to return. For me, Rhodes Island is that sheath.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Post-Promotion Talk 1","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2000,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Post-Promotion Talk 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2001,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Elite Promotion 1","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2002,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Elite Promotion 2","text":null,"category":"unused","status":"unused","unlock":null,"order":2003,"availablePacks":["cn","en","jp","kr"]}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Jessica Mcdonald"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/58e999c42e9fb00832d571ab35a1666000557088/current/char_502_nblade/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"i